# CODEOWNERS — who is asked to review what.
#
# See MAINTAINERS.md for the role definitions. `ebk-slm` is the repository
# maintainer and, at present, the only one, so every path defaults to them.
#
# NOTE: `require_code_owner_reviews` is deliberately left off in the branch
# protection rule. With a single maintainer, requiring code-owner approval
# would block every PR — including the maintainer's own — because an author
# cannot approve their own pull request. Turn it on when a second person
# accepts a domain-maintainer role.

*                       @ebk-slm

